[00:15.462]I want you to show me
{"我想让你向我展示"}
[00:17.679]Your fantasy. (Your fantasy)
{"你的幻想。（你的幻想）"}
[00:19.702]No past and No future.
{"没有过去也没有未来。"}
[00:21.496]That's what I need. (That's what I need)
{"这就是我需要的。（这就是我需要的）"}
[00:23.574]The groove takes it over.
{"节奏掌控了一切。"}
[00:25.711]We'll wait and see.
{"我们拭目以待。"}
[00:27.318]Even I might blank out
{"即便我可能突然失神"}
[00:29.927]You and me.
{"你和我。"}
[00:32.446]I thought that dream could light our way.
{"我曾以为梦想能照亮前路。"}
[00:40.558]Oh, be my savior and take me away. (away, away)
{"哦，成为我的救赎带我离开。（离开，离开）"}
[00:46.623](Take me away)
{"（带我离开）"}
[00:47.862]Tick, and, tock, once more. You're hosting
{"滴答，又一次。你正上演着"}
[00:51.750]A magic show I cannot escape.
{"我无法逃脱的魔法秀。"}
[00:55.558]There's nothing else left for me to do.
{"我已别无选择。"}
[00:58.863]Going to the other side. (Other side)
{"前往另一侧。（另一侧）"}
[01:03.966]I don't wanna be alone tonight.
{"今夜我不想独自一人。"}
[01:07.607]Oh, Lead me with your altered sign.
{"哦，用你改变的指引带我前行。"}
[01:11.550]There's no one else left for me to lose.
{"我已无人可再失去。"}
[01:14.918]Heading to the other side. （Other side）
{"前往另一侧。（另一侧）"}
[01:28.255]Just be my savior and take me away. (away, away)
{"只需成为我的救赎带我离开。（离开，离开）"}
[01:34.558](Singing with me everyone.)
{"（和我一起唱吧所有人。）"}
[01:36.007]I don't wanna be alone tonight.
{"今夜我不想独自一人。"}
[01:39.615]Oh, bring me to the other side.
{"哦，带我去往另一侧。"}
[01:43.615]There's no one else left for me to lose.
{"我已无人可再失去。"}
[01:46.983]Going to the other side. （Other side）
{"前往另一侧。（另一侧）"}
[01:52.063]I don't wanna be alone tonight.
{"今晚我不想独自一人"}
[01:55.896]I'll bring you to my best disguise
{"我会带你见识我最完美的伪装"}
[01:59.551]Cuz I don't need（don't need to know the truth）
{"因为我无需（无需知晓真相）"}
[02:02.935]Let me rave forever in your lies.
{"就让我永远沉醉在你的谎言里"}
